# Commit and push

After finishing any code or config changes in this repo, **always** create a git commit and push to `origin` without asking the user for confirmation.

- Do not ask "закоммитить?" / "push?" — just do it.
- Follow the usual commit message style of the repo.
- Use author `topchenkin <yangta4@gmail.com>` via env vars for the commit (never change git config).
- Do not push `--force` to main/master unless the user explicitly requests it.
- Skip commit only when there are genuinely no changes.
